<title>USA: NHL ICE HOCKEY-FRIDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</title>
<headline>NHL ICE HOCKEY-FRIDAY'S STANLEY CUP PLAYOFF RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of first-round</p>
<p>National Hockey League Stanley Cup playoff games on Friday</p>
<p>(home team in CAPS):</p>
<p>		   EASTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> Ny Rangers	  3  FLORIDA		  2 (OT)</p>
<p>(New York wins best-of-seven series 4-1)</p>
<p> Ottawa		4  BUFFALO		  1</p>
<p>(Ottawa leads best-of-seven series 3-2)</p>
<p>		   WESTERN CONFERENCE</p>
<p> DETROIT	     5  St Louis		 2</p>
<p>(Detroit leads best-of-seven series 3-2)</p>
<p> Edmonton	    1  DALLAS		   0 (2-OT)</p>
<p>(Edmonton leads best-of-seven series 3-2)</p>
</text>
